+## Method and scope
+
+- CPython: 20,000 states × 31 repetitions; 3.12.13 (main, Mar  3 2026, 14:59:34) [Clang 21.1.4 ]; NumPy 2.5.1.
+- C11: 200,000 states × 31 repetitions; compiler 13.3.0; CLOCK_MONOTONIC.
+- Payload is fixed at 10 bytes for CR80, 11 bytes for CR88, and 16 bytes for either Control-128 profile.
+- CR88 adds exactly 10% storage per state and carries profile/status metadata per word.
+- Input construction, file I/O and frame transport are outside the timed region.
+- Energy, interrupt latency, cache isolation and embedded targets were not measured.
+- 20 of 22 reported operations met their predeclared p95 tolerance on this host.
+- All ten HVE 2.5 CR88, Laplacian, and conversion measurements met their p95 tolerances.
+- Tolerance misses: CPython scalar Control-128/v3 encode, CPython scalar Control-128/v4 encode.
